This repository contains the Antevo plugins (Executive, Trademark, Wealth and
Mandates): their manifests and Agent Skills, for use with Claude and other
MCP-compatible AI assistants.

You may install and use these plugins to connect to the Antevo services, subject to
the Antevo Terms of Use (https://antevo.ch/policies/terms-of-use) and Privacy Policy
(https://antevo.ch/policies/privacy-policy). Executive and trademark screening need
no account. Antevo Wealth requires an Antevo Wealth account; Antevo Mandates requires
a firm account, by arrangement with Antevo.

